{"id":"5fa65e4ea7ccdaff","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice.md","title":"无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现","display":"ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice — 无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice","aliases":["72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice"],"display":"ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice — 无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §2.3 and §3.1.1–3.1.2, print346–347,352/PDF358–359,364; explicit matrix calculation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice — 无量词选择模式的显式 Dialectica 实现"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d5d9a828cab1327\" href=\"?note=4d5d9a828cab1327\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles\">72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §2.3 and §3.1.1–3.1.2, print346–347,352/PDF358–359,364; explicit matrix calculation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\)</span>，x:σ、y:τ 为指定变量，F:σ→τ 为新鲜变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:=\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)\">\\(P:=\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d5d9a828cab1327\" href=\"?note=4d5d9a828cab1327\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles\">72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</a>。不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w(\\theta),c(\\theta)\">\\(w(\\theta),c(\\theta)\\)</span> 为空。</li>\n<li>Dialectica 矩阵、类型表函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,c,\\operatorname{Arr},\\operatorname{Fun}\">\\(w,c,\\operatorname{Arr},\\operatorname{Fun}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>；类型、适型项及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span> 使用其有限类型算术接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec r,\\vec v\">\\(\\vec r,\\vec v\\)</span> 为与 θ 全部变量互异的新鲜带类型变量表，类型表分别为下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\kappa\">\\(\\rho,\\kappa\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\">\\(\\vec z\\)</span> 遍历有限带类型变量表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是合法项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t)\\)</span> 在下式作有限语法递归。元组应用逐分量curry，不引入乘积类型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nL&amp;:=\\forall x^\\sigma\\exists y^\\tau\\theta,\\qquad\nR:=\\exists F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\forall x^\\sigma\\theta[Fx/y],\\\\\n\\rho&amp;:=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\tau\\rangle^\\frown\\operatorname{Fun}(\\langle\\sigma\\rangle,w(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\kappa&amp;:=\\langle\\sigma\\rangle^\\frown c(\\theta),\\\\\nw(L)&amp;=w(R)=\\rho,\\qquad c(L)=c(R)=\\kappa,\\\\\nw(P)&amp;=\\operatorname{Fun}(\\rho,\\rho)^\\frown\\operatorname{Fun}(\\rho^\\frown\\kappa,\\kappa),\\qquad c(P)=\\rho^\\frown\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nL&amp;:=\\forall x^\\sigma\\exists y^\\tau\\theta,\\qquad\nR:=\\exists F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\forall x^\\sigma\\theta[Fx/y],\\\\\n\\rho&amp;:=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\tau\\rangle^\\frown\\operatorname{Fun}(\\langle\\sigma\\rangle,w(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\kappa&amp;:=\\langle\\sigma\\rangle^\\frown c(\\theta),\\\\\nw(L)&amp;=w(R)=\\rho,\\qquad c(L)=c(R)=\\kappa,\\\\\nw(P)&amp;=\\operatorname{Fun}(\\rho,\\rho)^\\frown\\operatorname{Fun}(\\rho^\\frown\\kappa,\\kappa),\\qquad c(P)=\\rho^\\frown\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Abs}(\\langle\\rangle;t)&amp;:=t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Abs}(\\langle z^\\mu\\rangle^\\frown\\vec z;t)&amp;:=\\lambda z^\\mu:\\mu.\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t),\\\\\n\\vec U&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec r;r_i):i&lt;|\\rho|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\vec Y&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec r^\\frown\\vec v;v_j):j&lt;|\\kappa|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Abs}(\\langle\\rangle;t)&amp;:=t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Abs}(\\langle z^\\mu\\rangle^\\frown\\vec z;t)&amp;:=\\lambda z^\\mu:\\mu.\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t),\\\\\n\\vec U&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec r;r_i):i&lt;|\\rho|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\vec Y&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec r^\\frown\\vec v;v_j):j&lt;|\\kappa|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;|\\rho|\\quad U_i\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Arr}(\\rho,\\rho_i)},\\qquad\n\\forall j&lt;|\\kappa|\\quad Y_j\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Arr}(\\rho^\\frown\\kappa,\\kappa_j)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i&lt;|\\rho|\\quad U_i\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Arr}(\\rho,\\rho_i)},\\qquad\n\\forall j&lt;|\\kappa|\\quad Y_j\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Arr}(\\rho^\\frown\\kappa,\\kappa_j)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_0\\vdash P_D(\\vec U,\\vec Y;\\vec r,\\vec v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_0\\vdash P_D(\\vec U,\\vec Y;\\vec r,\\vec v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前件的第一见证分量给选择函数，其余分量给 θ 自身的见证函数；前件与后件的挑战均由 x 和 θ 的挑战组成。两侧的完整类型表因此分别相同。U 把每个前件见证分量原样传给后件，Y 把每个后件挑战原样传回前件。对这些封闭投影项逐项 β 化简后，两侧矩阵是同一个 θ_D 实例，故所得蕴涵由 T₀ 的重言式与计算等式可证。</p>\n<p>原稿只传递选择函数与 x，遗漏含析取的无量词 θ 引入的额外标签。本式保留全部 w(θ)、c(θ)，故覆盖本节声明的任意无量词矩阵；当两表均空时，恰退化为原来的两个标量恒等项。这里验证的是 AC 的 Dialectica 矩阵，没有在基础直觉主义理论中证明 AC 本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","status":"resolved","id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","status":"resolved","id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$，x:σ、y:τ 为指定变量，F:σ→τ 为新鲜变量；$P:=\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]。不要求 $w(\\theta),c(\\theta)$ 为空。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Dialectica 矩阵、类型表函数 $w,c,\\operatorname{Arr},\\operatorname{Fun}$ 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]；类型、适型项及 $T_0$ 使用其有限类型算术接口。$\\vec r,\\vec v$ 为与 θ 全部变量互异的新鲜带类型变量表，类型表分别为下式的 $\\rho,\\kappa$。$\\vec z$ 遍历有限带类型变量表，$t$ 是合法项；$\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t)$ 在下式作有限语法递归。元组应用逐分量curry，不引入乘积类型。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"P:=\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"w(\\theta),c(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"w,c,\\operatorname{Arr},\\operatorname{Fun}","display":false},{"tex":"T_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec r,\\vec v","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nL&:=\\forall x^\\sigma\\exists y^\\tau\\theta,\\qquad\nR:=\\exists F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\forall x^\\sigma\\theta[Fx/y],\\\\\n\\rho&:=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\tau\\rangle^\\frown\\operatorname{Fun}(\\langle\\sigma\\rangle,w(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\kappa&:=\\langle\\sigma\\rangle^\\frown c(\\theta),\\\\\nw(L)&=w(R)=\\rho,\\qquad c(L)=c(R)=\\kappa,\\\\\nw(P)&=\\operatorname{Fun}(\\rho,\\rho)^\\frown\\operatorname{Fun}(\\rho^\\frown\\kappa,\\kappa),\\qquad c(P)=\\rho^\\frown\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Abs}(\\langle\\rangle;t)&:=t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Abs}(\\langle z^\\mu\\rangle^\\frown\\vec z;t)&:=\\lambda z^\\mu:\\mu.\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec z;t),\\\\\n\\vec U&:=\\langle\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec r;r_i):i<|\\rho|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\vec Y&:=\\langle\\operatorname{Abs}(\\vec r^\\frown\\vec v;v_j):j<|\\kappa|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall i<|\\rho|\\quad U_i\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Arr}(\\rho,\\rho_i)},\\qquad\n\\forall j<|\\kappa|\\quad Y_j\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Arr}(\\rho^\\frown\\kappa,\\kappa_j)}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_0\\vdash P_D(\\vec U,\\vec Y;\\vec r,\\vec v).","display":true}],"bytes":3463,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-519","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"}],"outgoing":["4d5d9a828cab1327","0dfc104a5d3297ad"]}